  "migrations": [],
  "name": "repo-docs",
  "ops": [
    {
      "content": "\n## repo-docs\n\nCommunity and repository hygiene files, written once as seeds you own.\n\nKey files:\n\n- `CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `GOVERNANCE.md`: contributor-facing rules.\n- `.github/CODEOWNERS`: review ownership.\n- `.editorconfig`: editor defaults.\n- `.git-blame-ignore-revs`: commits `git blame` skips; add formatting-only commits here.\n",
